WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.058
"Ow! It hurts!" cried Mole.

2
00:00:06.059 --> 00:00:10.419
He was rolling in the snow, holding his leg.

3
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.768
"Poor Mole," said Rat kindly.

4
00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:15.678
"Let me look."

5
00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:20.759
Mole sat still, and Rat bent down.

6
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:25.023
"Well, you really hurt yourself," said Rat.

7
00:00:25.024 --> 00:00:29.643
"I tripped over a stump," cried Mole.

8
00:00:29.644 --> 00:00:32.771
"But it's a clean cut," said Rat.

9
00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:37.966
"It looks like you hit something sharp, like metal."

10
00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:41.445
"It hurts!" cried Mole.

11
00:00:41.446 --> 00:00:45.769
Rat tied up Mole's cut with his handkerchief.

12
00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:51.853
"Hmm, metal," said Rat. "I wonder."

13
00:00:51.854 --> 00:00:56.925
Rat started scratching in the snow.

14
00:00:56.926 --> 00:01:00.011
"What are you doing?" asked Mole.

15
00:01:00.012 --> 00:01:04.299
Rat didn't answer, but he dug harder.

16
00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.013
"Hey!" cried Mole.

17
00:01:07.014 --> 00:01:10.233
"What's going on?"

18
00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:12.813
Suddenly Rat stood.

19
00:01:12.814 --> 00:01:16.080
He held something in his hand.

20
00:01:16.081 --> 00:01:19.671
"What did you find, Ratty?" asked Mole.

21
00:01:19.672 --> 00:01:22.702
"Come and see!" said Rat.

22
00:01:22.703 --> 00:01:26.396
Mole walked over to have a look.

23
00:01:26.397 --> 00:01:30.832
"It looks like a broken door knocker," said Mole.

24
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:34.153
"What does that tell you?" asked Rat.

25
00:01:34.154 --> 00:01:37.531
"Uh, nothing," said Mole.

26
00:01:37.532 --> 00:01:43.937
"Oh, stop standing there!" cried Rat. "Dig!"

27
00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:47.054
Rat clawed at the snow.

28
00:01:47.055 --> 00:01:50.641
White flakes flew all around him.

29
00:01:50.642 --> 00:01:55.318
"Why are you so excited?" asked Mole.

30
00:01:55.319 --> 00:02:01.010
Rat just kept digging, so Mole dug too.

31
00:02:01.011 --> 00:02:05.704
"I don't know what we're digging for," said Mole.

32
00:02:05.705 --> 00:02:09.119
"It was just an old door knocker."

33
00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.908
Suddenly Rat stopped.

34
00:02:11.909 --> 00:02:17.287
"Look at this!" he shouted.

35
00:02:17.288 --> 00:02:24.500
Mole looked. There was something under the snow.

